{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51095","headline":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 淮南 · 崔致远","name":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 淮南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八郡荣超陶太尉，三边静掩霍嫖姚。\n玉皇终日留金鼎，应待淮王手自调。\n（原注：剑南、荆南、淮南，乃天下名镇，相公累移节制。\n西戎、南蛮、东鄙贼起，相公皆自讨除。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}